Dear reviewers,

We thank you for spending time reviewing our paper. Please find the answers to your questions in our replies to your reviews. We have incorporated your suggestions into the paper (the changes are highlighted with the blue color) and uploaded the updated version. The major changes are:

(1) We added Figure 4 to Section 4.2 with the **scheme of our method**;

(2) We added additional qualitative results in **2D examples** (Figure 18 in Appendix B.3);

(3) We added quantitative and qualitative evaluation of our method on the Wasserstein-2 benchmark to show that it **recovers OT maps well** (Appendix B.2, Table 4 and Figure 10);

(4) We added additional experiments in generative modeling of **Celeba 128x128** (Figure 11).

Please consider the updated version and respond to our replies to let us know if the clarifications and additions suitably address your concerns about our work.  We are happy to address any remaining points during the discussion phase.
